    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323-a6">

                <pb facs="0627" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1877/pg579"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in Mr. Fottion’s No.
                        13.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consular Agency</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mytilene</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-04-15">15 (27) <hi rendition="#italic">April</hi>,
                            1877</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 16.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir and Dear Colleague</hi>: I have the honor to
                    reply to your dispatch No. 20, and to thank you infinitely for the honor you
                    have done me, viz: that, in the absence of a German vice-consulate in this city,
                    you place the Russian subjects resident in the hounds of your jurisdiction under
                    American protection. But, since this difficult question <pb facs="0628" n="580"
                        xml:id="pg580"/> does not rest with me, I shall have to ask for instructions
                    from my superiors, to whom I this day transmit your request, and I wait for
                    their instructions at the earliest possible moment.</p>
                <p>Please accept, sir and dear colleague, the assurance of my perfect
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>M. M. FOTTION,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States Consular
                                    Agent</hi></item>
                            <item>Mr. G. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Amira</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Vice-Consul of Russia at
                                Mytilene.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
